OL,3,GNEWSAMen guilty of abusing woman
OL,4,Adrugged and advertised for sex by
OL,5,Ahusband
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour men have been found guilty of
OL,8,Fsexually abusing a woman whose husband
OL,9,Fdrugged and secretly advertised her for
OL,10,Fsex on the internet.
OL,12,FPhilip Young, 50, already pleaded
OL,13,Fguilty to multiple charges of drugging
OL,14,Fand raping his wife, Joanne Young, over
OL,15,Fa 13-year period at their home in
OL,16,FSwindon, Wiltshire.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
