OL,3,GNEWSAMen guilty of abusing woman
OL,4,Adrugged and advertised for sex by
OL,5,Ahusband
OL,6,
OL,7,FNorman Macksoni, 48, Richard Wilkins,
OL,8,F62, Connor Sanderson-Doyle, 32, and
OL,9,FMohammed Hassan, 38, were found guilty
OL,10,Fof multiple sexual offences by a jury
OL,11,Fat Winchester Crown Court. Wilkins and
OL,12,FMacksoni were each found guilty of one
OL,13,Fcount of rape.
OL,15,FJoanne Young, who has waived her right
OL,16,Fto anonymity, beamed at police as she
OL,17,Fleft court wiping her eyes.
